    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17776" root="زعفر" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَعْفَرَانٌ</span></b>  <i>A certain dye and perfume,</i> (TA,)
<i>well-known;</i> (Msb, K;) [namely, <i>saffron:</i>] if it
be in a house or chamber, the [lizard called] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَامُّ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْرَصَ</span> will not enter it: (K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَعَافِرُ</span>. (S, K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also (assumed tropical:)  The <i>rust</i> of iron: pl. as above. (K.)

